Before closing the construction contract, what must be agreed with the main contractor?
A) The final account, including all variations and claims
B) The marketing plan for selling the remaining apartments
C) The contractor's staffing plan for its next project
D) The design of the building's next phase
= A
? The final account settles the total amount due under the contract, including approved variations and resolved claims.

@@ PR10 | Agile
The game uses licensed middleware. Which closure task is easy to overlook when development ends and live operations begin?
A) Confirming the licence terms and transferring the licences for live operations
B) Deleting the middleware from the build, since development has now finished
C) Asking the middleware vendor to support the game free of charge from now on
D) Cancel the middleware licences, since the game has now been released to players
= A
? Closure includes administrative transfers. Licences needed to operate the product must be confirmed and handed over to the operating team.

@@ PR10 | Hybrid
A clinical trial is stopped early for safety reasons. What should its closure include?
A) Notify the authorities, close the sites, archive the data and record lessons
B) Deleting the trial data, since the trial did not reach its planned end point
C) Continuing to enrol patients until the sponsor makes a final decision
D) Moving the remaining budget to the next trial without any documentation
= A
? Early termination still requires a formal close-out that follows regulatory requirements and preserves the data and lessons.

