@@ PR10 | Hybrid
Which closure activity reduces ongoing costs after the project ends?
A) Cancelling project-specific contracts, licences and facilities
B) Keeping the project office open in case it is needed again
C) Extending the team members' contracts for another quarter as a precaution
D) Renewing all of the project's software subscriptions
= A
? Closing administrative arrangements, such as leases, subscriptions and contracts, stops costs that the organisation no longer needs to pay.

